omaxian-session (1.0.3-4) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Depend on omaxian-fonts-nerd: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font is mandatory
    for the Omaxian session (kitty/alacritty/ghostty, i3 bar, dunst,
    Quickshell) and is now installed system-wide, not only per user.
  * ACPI power button: new omaxian-xfpm-defaults, run at X login from
    Xsession.d/36omaxian-xfpm (before xfconfd/xfce4-power-manager start),
    sets power-button-action=4 (shut down) in the user's
    xfce4-power-manager channel when the user has not chosen a value.
    xfpm's default 3 ("ask") needs the xfce4-session logout dialog, which
    the i3 session does not run, so the power button (incl. a hypervisor
    ACPI power-off) did nothing. xfce4-power-manager's conffile is left
    untouched (diverting another package's conffile is not supported by
    dpkg: the diverted copy is skipped on install and purge deletes the
    original).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.3-3) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * omaxian-seed-keyboard (run from Xsession.d/25omaxian-home): create
    ~/.config/omarchy/keyboard.json from /etc/default/keyboard (XKBLAYOUT,
    XKBVARIANT, XKBOPTIONS) at first login, so the installer's keyboard
    choice is used instead of omarchy-keyboard-apply's built-in it,ru.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:20:00 +0100

